				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					444
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				916
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδεὶς ἔ. ἐφάπτεται μαντικῆς ἐνθέου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					71e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. γίγνομαι</span> I come <i>to
				my senses,</i>
