				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1270
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				31.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. γεγονέναι ὅτι</span> . .
			to be <i>aware</i> that . ., <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				10.20
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννούστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
